120
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:42,720
An inspector checks to assure precise fitting of parts.

121
00:14:47,620 --> 00:14:51,720
To assemble and disassemble the reactor, special handling tools have been designed.

122
00:14:52,500 --> 00:14:56,500
These tools will also be used in the future maintenance and refueling of the reactor.

123
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:04,200
The fuel container, often referred to as the egg crate, is set in its place.

