126
00:15:17,620 --> 00:15:38,139
Other components are added to this strange, upright boiler.

127
00:15:38,139 --> 00:15:42,460
Now the unit is ready to receive the control rods.

128
00:15:42,460 --> 00:15:49,700
During reactor operations, the level of insertion and withdrawal of these rods within the core

129
00:15:49,700 --> 00:16:07,660
