134
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:40,480
a Savannah engineer, an officer of the Coast Guard, checks out those units, which will

135
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:49,139
convert the reactor's power to ship's power. The containment area is monitored before fueling

136
00:16:49,139 --> 00:16:59,680
to obtain a reading on its natural radiation level. Every item is checked. After fueling,

137
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:01,040
